UP!
Persona!

00:15:46.446 --> 00:15:48.073
Doesn't it mean a lot to you?

00:15:48.982 --> 00:15:52.213
You seemed really sad after you threw it.

00:15:52.886 --> 00:15:54.820
So, here.

00:16:13.373 --> 00:16:15.068
Oh, my...

00:16:15.709 --> 00:16:19.746
I was so happy when my husband
gave this to me.

00:16:19.746 --> 00:16:23.614
I couldn't see his face through all my tears.

00:16:23.984 --> 00:16:28.853
I... I truly did love my husband, didn't I?

00:16:37.297 --> 00:16:38.127
Shu!

00:16:39.432 --> 00:16:40.763
M-Mister!

00:16:41.634 --> 00:16:42.658
What's that?

00:16:43.203 --> 00:16:44.371
Isn't it?

00:16:44.371 --> 00:16:46.635
I don't want any fireworks!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:50.976
Everyone in class was promising
they'd watch the fireworks together.

00:16:51.778 --> 00:16:55.009
But no one invited me to tag along.

00:16:55.448 --> 00:16:58.508
Everyone's just jealous of me
because they're stupid!

00:16:58.651 --> 00:17:00.553
So now no one gets fireworks!

00:17:00.553 --> 00:17:02.522
I'm going to put everyone out!

00:17:02.522 --> 00:17:03.489
Shu...

00:17:04.724 --> 00:17:06.658
I have something for you.

00:17:09.129 --> 00:17:10.289
Othello
Eppon Inc.

00:17:10.597 --> 00:17:12.155
What is it?

00:17:12.665 --> 00:17:15.156
Happy Birthday, Shu.

00:17:15.535 --> 00:17:16.832
How'd you know?

00:17:17.203 --> 00:17:21.007
I noticed a picture in your room
that said today is your birthday.

00:17:21.007 --> 00:17:23.441
But why did you choose this?

00:17:24.344 --> 00:17:26.813
It's a game you can't play by yourself.

00:17:26.813 --> 00:17:29.373
You'll have to ask someone to play with you.

00:17:30.016 --> 00:17:32.280
But everyone's so goofy...

00:17:32.652 --> 00:17:34.254
Does it matter?

00:17:34.254 --> 00:17:34.921
I need a toilet...
It's fun goofing off with everyone.

00:17:34.921 --> 00:17:35.922
That's lame.
It's fun goofing off with everyone.

00:17:35.922 --> 00:17:37.549
That's what you get for devouring shaved ice!
It's fun goofing off with everyone.

00:17:41.795 --> 00:17:45.565
Mister, I stole the fireworks...

00:17:45.565 --> 00:17:46.466
Let's give them back!

00:17:46.466 --> 00:17:47.398
Huh?

00:17:47.534 --> 00:17:49.335
I'll apologize with you later.

00:17:49.335 --> 00:17:50.870
For now, just leave it to me!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:52.539
Look what you did!

00:17:52.539 --> 00:17:55.275
What? It wasn't my fault!

00:17:55.275 --> 00:17:56.643
You did that on purpose!

00:17:56.643 --> 00:17:57.735
Now, now, Yuu...

00:17:57.944 --> 00:18:00.572
Give it a rest, really!

00:18:00.914 --> 00:18:04.645
Kids with moms like this
always turn out rotten.

00:18:05.351 --> 00:18:10.356
Well, this is about what I'd expect
from a failure of a mother.

00:18:10.356 --> 00:18:12.517
But I...

00:18:16.396 --> 00:18:18.091
Why you little brat!

00:18:18.298 --> 00:18:19.390
Yuu!

00:18:24.304 --> 00:18:26.067
Hey! Wake up!

00:18:26.473 --> 00:18:27.599
What in the?

00:18:30.477 --> 00:18:31.578
What happened?

00:18:31.578 --> 00:18:32.840
Mister...

00:18:32.946 --> 00:18:33.546
I... It wasn't my fault!

00:18:33.546 --> 00:18:35.381
She's bleeding bad!
I... It wasn't my fault!

00:18:35.381 --> 00:18:38.952
Mister, help her. Please help her!

00:18:38.952 --> 00:18:39.976
Sure thing!

