00:19:31.271 --> 00:19:32.363
Mom!

00:19:33.206 --> 00:19:34.571
Yuu?

00:19:35.175 --> 00:19:37.609
Mom!

00:19:39.379 --> 00:19:40.971
It looks like she'll be okay.

00:19:41.247 --> 00:19:42.048
Yeah, thanks.

00:19:42.048 --> 00:19:43.116
Mom! Mom!
Yeah, thanks.

00:19:43.116 --> 00:19:45.346
Mom! Mom!

00:19:47.053 --> 00:19:50.557
