00:20:43.042 --> 00:20:46.679
Saving lives truly is wonderful, isn't it?

00:20:46.679 --> 00:20:49.978
I can't believe I forgot something so simple.

00:20:50.149 --> 00:20:53.585
But you helped me remember. Thank you.

00:20:56.189 --> 00:21:01.060
Thank you for helping me regain my memories.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.789
I shall cherish them this time.

00:21:03.129 --> 00:21:05.222
